{
  "_about": [
    "The 2026-09-09 Champions update, staged before the servers opened.",
    "",
    "WHAT THIS FILE IS FOR, after a correction. Most of what is here was",
    "already in the repository and I did not check before going to the web.",
    "data/raw/pokedex.json carries all 1517 species -- including the four",
    "Champions-original Megas -- and the dex loads them; what the patch changes",
    "is not the dex but the *roster*, which lives in regulation_m_b.json and",
    "comes from Bulbapedia's Regulation Set page rather than from Showdown.",
    "",
    "So this file is now two things: an independent check on the stats already",
    "in the repo, and a record of what is genuinely missing.",
    "",
    "PROVENANCE, and the problem with it. The stats below came from",
    "pokemondb.net and bulbapedia, which describe the mainline games. The ones",
    "already in the repo came from play.pokemonshowdown.com. hk's standing",
    "instruction is not to treat Showdown as the truth about Champions, and",
    "that applies to every base stat the dex currently holds -- not just to the",
    "new ones. Both sources agree for the mainline species; neither is the game.",
    "",
    "Korean names are hk's, verbatim. English names were resolved by search:",
    "Thievul, Clodsire and Baxcalibur were looked up rather than guessed.",
    "",
    "Learnsets are not here. hk supplies those once the servers are open."
  ],
  "confirmed": false,
  "source": "pokemondb.net and bulbapedia (mainline); Champions values unverified",
  "open_questions": [
    "Learnsets need a full refresh, not an append: hk says existing species have gained and lost moves as well. Showdown's learnsets.json will not carry that, so the source has to be Champions itself.",
    "파오리 is listed with no form note, unlike 페르시온 (알로라의 모습). Kantonian is assumed, but 창파나이트 evolves from the Galarian one.",
    "Every ability in the species list is still from pokemondb or Showdown and unchecked against the game -- 빠르모트's three included. Samurott is why that matters: the repo says Torrent and Shell Armor, and Champions gives it Emergency Exit."
  ],
